{"id":"d802e87a48","title":"Sv overview","template":"<section class=\"section sv-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"sd-wan-connectivity-services-s1\">\n  <div class=\"container sv-overview__grid\">\n    <div class=\"sv-overview__copy\">\n      \n    <div class=\"sv-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">{{s0}}</p>\n      <h2 class=\"grad-head\" id=\"sd-wan-connectivity-services-s1\">{{s1}}</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n      <div class=\"sv-prose sv-prose--lede\"><p>{{s2}}</p><p>{{s3}}</p><p>{{s4}}</p></div>\n      \n      <p class=\"sv-links\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{u5}}\"><span>{{s6}}</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sv-overview__media\">\n      <figure class=\"media ratio-4-5 sv-overview__photo\">\n    {{i7}}\n  </figure>\n      <p class=\"sv-overview__tag\"><span class=\"sv-overview__tag-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2.5\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"16.5\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"15.5\" y=\"16.5\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5V12M5.5 16.5V12h13v4.5\"/></svg></span><span>{{s8}}<strong>{{s9}}</strong></span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sv-included\">\n      <p class=\"sv-included__label\">{{s10}}</p>\n      <ul class=\"sv-ticks\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s11}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s12}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s13}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s14}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s15}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s16}}</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"Overview"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Connectivity you can count on"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"When your internet drops, so does your business, cloud apps, email, phones and card payments all rely on it. A single connection with no backup is a single point of failure."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"WhizzIT sources and manages the right connectivity for each site, adds automatic failover, and uses SD-WAN to intelligently route traffic across links, so you get resilient, prioritised, always-on connectivity you don’t have to think about."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Connectivity is designed around how your sites actually communicate, then managed as one service rather than several separate supplier relationships. It is priced per user at a fixed monthly cost rather than bundled into rigid packages, so it scales with your team. Everything runs through the same UK service desk that handles your day-to-day tickets, so there is no separate team to chase. Across 2025 our average first response time was 9 minutes and our average resolution time was 6 hours, measured across every ticket we handled."},{"k":"u5","type":"u","label":"Link: Back to Network Management","default":"/network-management/"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"Back to Network Management"},{"k":"i7","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-sd-wan-connectivity-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-sd-wan-connectivity-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-sd-wan-connectivity-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-sd-wan-connectivity-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Bundle of glowing blue fibre optic strands on a dark background\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-sd-wan-connectivity-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Network Management"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"SD-WAN & Connectivity"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"What’s included"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Leased lines and business broadband"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"4G/5G automatic failover"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"SD-WAN for intelligent, resilient routing"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Multi-site and branch connectivity"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Traffic prioritisation (QoS) for voice and cloud"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Monitoring and managed support"}]}